{
  "id": "LEV.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Eby'Abalevita 10",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadabu na Abihu batabani ba Aroni, buli omoi akwata ekyotezo ekye, akitamu omuliro, omuliro agutaho obunuma, aguhongera Omukama. Kyonkai omuliro ogwo gukaba guli guhagare kuba Omukama akaba atagubaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuliro guruga omu maisho g'Omukama gubokya, bagwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Musa agambira Aroni ati, “Eki nikyo Omukama yagambire ati, ‘Abalinkolera bona bamanye okwo mba mutakatifu; kandi abantu bona ndiboleka ekitinwa kyange.’ ” Kyonkai Aroni ayesiza atekana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ayeta Mishaeli na Elisafani, batabani ba Uzieli, nyinarumi Aroni, abagambira ati, “Ija aha mwihye barumuna banyu omw'Ihema litakatifu, mubatware enjai y'orusisira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo baija, babashohoza nkabwo omu nyambarwa zabo enjai y'orusisira nk'okwo Musa yabaire yagambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agambira Aroni n'abatabani Eleazari na Itamari ati, “Mutakweshurura mitwe kuzora ishoke, nangu n'okutagura ebijwaro byanyu. Kamwakuchura, Omukama yakunigalira enteko yona na inywe mufa. Kyonkai Abaisiraeli bona barumuna banyu, nibajuburwa kuchura aha rw'orufu orwaletwa omuliro ogw'Omukama yahemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutakuruga aha mulyango gwa Ihema lya Muterano kuturuka aheru, mutaija mukafa, ahakuba mukozirwe amajuta g'Omukama.” Bakora nk'okwo Musa yagambire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Aroni ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe na batabani bawe mutalinywa marwa mukataha mw'Ihema lya Muterano mutalija mukafa. Eki kiliba kiragiro eirai lyona omu mizarwa yanyu yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuragirwa Musaine kwahurana ebintu ebitakatifu n'ebintu ebya buli kiro, ebihagare n'ebilikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muli b'okwegesa Abaisiraeli ebiragiro byona ey'Omukama yabagambiire omu kanwa ka Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agambira Aroni n'abatabani Eleazari na Itamari, abasigaireho ati, “Mukwatega ekihongo ky'emyaka ekirasigarahoga aha bihongo by'Omukama ebirayokesibwaga omuliro, mukilye kitatumbisiibwe aha kabaju ka alutare, aha rw'okuba kitakatifu muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukiliirega omu mwanya gutakatifu aha rw'enshonga mugabo gwawe na batabani bawe ogurarugaga aha bihongo by'Omukama ebirayokesibwaga omuliro. Nikwo Ruhanga yampangiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai enkoro erachunkezibwaga n'ekirumbu ekirahongwaga murabiliraga omu mwanya gwona gwona ogulikwera, iwe na batabani bawe na bahara bawe. Ebyo ahali iwe nibijuburwa: Mugabo gwawe na batabani bawe kuruga aha bitambo by'ebihongo by'emilembe ebiragirwaga Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekirumbu ekirahongwaga n'enkoro erachunkezibwaga, babileterane n'ebihongo by'ebishaju eby'okwokesibwa omuliro, babichunkeze omu maisho g'Omukama. Kiliba kyawe na batabani bawe; mugabo gwanyu eirai lyona, nk'okwo Omukama ahangire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Musa abaliliza bunyanungi aha mbuzi y'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu, ashanga yayokiibwe! Anigalira Eleazari na Itamari, batabani ba Aroni abasigaireho nagamba ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kubaki mutaliira kihongo kya nyatano ya bufu ahatakatifu? Aha rw'enshonga kintu ekitakatifu muno. Omukama yakibaha kumwatilira entambara y'enteko ahali wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'obwamba bwayo timubutahize hatakatifu omunda. Taliho kindi, mwaba nimuragirwa kugilira ahatakatifu omunda nk'okwo ndagiire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni agambira Musa ati, “Kir'eki abantu bahongera Omukama ekihongo kyabo ky'enyatano y'obufu n'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa; kyonkai leba, ebyangwaho! Isi kuba kir'eki nalya ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu Omukama yakukikunzire?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Musa yahuliire ekigambo ekyo, agwelera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
